flowchart LR
 Request --> AuthN[Authenticate]
 AuthN --> Risk[Session/Device/Risk Context]
 Risk --> Tenant[Tenant Resolution]
 Tenant --> Class[Data/Resource Classification]
 Class --> PDP[Policy Decision Point]
 PDP --> MFA{Step-Up Required?}
 MFA -->|Yes| Step[Strong Reauthentication/MFA]
 MFA -->|No| PEP[Policy Enforcement]
 Step --> PEP
 PEP --> Service[Authorized Service/Tool]
 Service --> Audit[Security + Business Audit]
 Service --> Telemetry[Security Telemetry]
 Telemetry --> Detect[Threat Detection]
 Detect --> Alert[Alert / Incident]
